  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Trim and halve green beans.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook green beans, tossing until tender, 4-5 minutes. Add Asian greens and cook, tossing until wilted, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85fc04264524ca9799809/step-02da0900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat, gently stirring with a fork to separate, until tender, 1-2 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85fc04264524ca9799809/step-f060df10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil When oil is hot, add tofu and cook, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, add ginger paste and Asian BBQ seasoning and cook, tossing until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add oyster sauce, the brown sugar, vinegar and water and cook, stirring until slightly thickened, 1 minute.\n• Return veggies to the frying pan, then add noodles and toss to combine. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85fc04264524ca9799809/step-7811e720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Asian-style tofu noodle stir-fry between bowls. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85fc04264524ca9799809/step-51386930.jpg"
    }
  ]
